flowchart LR
    A[User Uploads Files or URL] --> B[Ingestion Service]
    B --> C[Parser Layer\nPDF OCR/Extract\nDOCX Sections\nXLSX Tab/Row\nWeb Section Extract]
    C --> D[Chunking + Metadata Mapper\n(page/tab-row/section)]
    D --> E[Embedding Model\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2]
    E --> M[(SQLite\nDocuments + Chunks + Embeddings + Sessions)]

    U[User Chat UI] --> S[Select/Unselect Resource State]
    S --> Q[Query API]
    Q --> G[Retriever\nSQL filter selected docs + cosine search]
    M --> G
    G --> H[LLM Orchestrator\nLocal Ollama chat API]
    H --> I[Citation Engine\nDirect quote + source + location]
    I --> U
